{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_047","slug":"fr2015-047-journal-d-une-femme-de-chambre","title":{"native":"Journal d'une femme de chambre","english":"Diary of a Chambermaid"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-04-01","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Benoît Jacquot","slug":"benoit-jacquot","name":"Benoît Jacquot","birthYear":1947,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Drama","Historical film (Heritage Film)"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/48/34/139824/format_page/journal-d-une-femme-de-chambre.png","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l1sUyN1KeSg"},"synopsis":{"native":"Début du XXème siècle, en province. Très courtisée pour sa beauté, Célestine est une jeune femme de chambre nouvellement arrivée de Paris au service de la famille Lanlaire. Repoussant les avances de Monsieur, Célestine doit également faire face à la très stricte Madame Lanlaire qui régit la maison d’une main de fer. Elle y fait la rencontre de Joseph, l’énigmatique jardinier de la propriété, pour lequel elle éprouve une véritable fascination.","english":"The beginning of the 20th century in provincial France. Highly sought after because of her beauty, Célestine is a young chambermaid who has just arrived from Paris into the service of the Lanlaire family. Rejecting Monsieur's overtures, Célestine must also cope with Madame Lanlaire, a strict and severe woman who rules the household with an iron fist. She makes the acquaintance of Joseph, the Lanlaire's mysterious gardener, and becomes fascinated by him."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2015_047_01","film":"FR2015_047","person":{"id":"Vincent Lindon","slug":"vincent-lindon","name":"Vincent Lindon","birthYear":1959,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[{"film":{"slug":"fr2015-073-la-lo